// - party scaling: on each hit by a player the boss counts players within 64 blocks (cap 4); if more than before, max
//   health gets +35% per extra player (modifier avgustov:party_scaling) and the current health keeps its share;
// - guns (ntgl:* damage, arrows): per-attacker damage-per-second cap; explosions and cannon shells: per-hit cap;
//   Cataclysm bosses keep their own caps (shared by all attackers), so no dps cap and no party scaling for them;
// - out: multiplier on the damage a boss deals to players, the lever for attacks that ignore ATTACK_DAMAGE.
// Every hook is wrapped in try/catch: an error inside a NeoForge damage event would be thrown from entity ticking and
// Neruina stops the server after a few (seen in testing 2026-11-18). JS catch only stops script errors (TypeError and
